OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA mostly dry start with bright
OL,6,Fspells, though some showers developing
OL,7,Ffrom around late morning. These could
OL,8,Fturn heavy at times, with the risk of
OL,9,Fthunder, before showers tend to move
OL,10,Faway eastwards by the late afternoon.
OL,11,FTemperatures around average.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FLargely dry for a time this
OL,14,Fevening with clear spells, before a
OL,15,Ffew more showers move in from the west
OL,16,Fovernight. These showers mostly light.
OL,17,FA cool night for some.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
