OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FSome bright spells for a
OL,6,Fwhile. However, heavy thundery showers
OL,7,Fmove southwards through the morning
OL,8,Fand into the afternoon. Showers
OL,9,Fturning a little lighter later on.
OL,10,FCooler than Wednesday.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:
OL,13,FTemperatures staying below average
OL,14,Finto the weekend. Isolated showers
OL,15,Fcontinuing on Friday, but becoming
OL,16,Fmore settled again heading into the
OL,17,Fweekend with an increasing number of
OL,18,Fsunny spells.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
